e done in our Spring Core project is happening here behind the scene. But then in your Spring Core project, we have done something more, right? We have worked with two classes for the computer. In fact, there's no computer interface here. And we have two classes, laptop and desktop. And then to solve the problems, we have used different annotations like primary and then qualifier. So let's see how do we use all those things here in the Spring Boot project? Apart from this, we have some variable as well. So apart from laptop, we also need a variable for age. And maybe I want to have getters, setters for that. I want to make this private. So all these things are not done in this project. So we'll do that in the upcoming videos. So basically, let me just close all these things. So this is where we have to make some changes. We want desktop class as well. So let's do that in the next video."
